    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ucuf](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ucuf) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 108.768 depth occurred on Nov 22 2026 11km NE of Carhuamayo. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -10.8352 longitude -76.0152. It impacted 148732 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
